    "PreviousBlocks": 1b,
    "DialogText": "Oh, you’re here for Bilbo’s deed. Tricky business. Bilbo gave it to me, but said I wasn’t to hand it over without a test. He was chuckling the whole time, said it would ‘keep @p sharp.’ 

Answer me this riddle, and the paper’s yours:

Born of fire and greed, I keep my hoard,
In cavern deep where green moss withers,
I crown the dark with wing and word,
And wake the mountains with my slither.
What am I?",
